">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e3158f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6e3158f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lemon Digital \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ea3 khi h\u00ecnh th\u00e0nh l\u00e0n s\u00f3ng Th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd nh\u01b0 ch\u00fang ta \u0111ang th\u1ea5y.<\/p><p>Kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi 2 th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean, sau v\u00e0i n\u0103m ch\u00fang t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng cho m\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1eb7n h\u01a1n. Quy m\u00f4 c\u00f4ng ty n\u1edf d\u1ea7n theo s\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c s\u00e0n. Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c eCommerce t\u1ea1i th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p><p>Ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111a d\u1ea1ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1eeb c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ebfn chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u xoay quanh Th\u01b0\u01a1ng M\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng c\u1ea3i ti\u1ebfn ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u00e0 l\u1eafng nghe ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. H\u01a1n 300 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u00e3 v\u00e0 \u0111ang \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng Lemon trong su\u1ed1t g\u1ea7n 5 n\u0103m h\u00ecnh th\u00e0nh, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i lu\u00f4n c\u1ed1 g\u1eafng h\u1ebft s\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c kinh doanh c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u1eadt d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng v\u00e0 b\u00f9ng n\u1ed5.<\/p><p>C\u1ea3m \u01a1n b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ebfn Website c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecdc nh\u1eefng d\u00f2ng n\u00e0y. Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i hy v\u1ecdng s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eb7p b\u1ea1n trong bu\u1ed5i t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a84e920 elementor-hidden-widescreen elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-laptop elementor-hidden-tablet_extra elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a84e920\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bae79ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bae79ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4768fd2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4768fd2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01fc2e6 elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-jet-timeline\" data-id=\"01fc2e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"jet-timeline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-jet-timeline jet-elements\"><div class=\"jet-timeline jet-timel